ic cells via Toll-like receptor-viral RNA interactions.</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><volume>115</volume><fpage>3265</fpage><lpage>75</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16224540</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001915-Meier1"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Meier</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Alter</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Frahm</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Sidhu</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>MyD88-dependent immune activation mediated by human immunodeficiency virus type 1-encoded toll-like receptor ligands.</article-title><source>J Virol</source><volume>81</volume><fpage>8180</fpage><lpage>91</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17507480</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001915-TennerRacz1"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tenner-Racz</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Racz</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Thome</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Meyer</surname><given-names>CG</given-names></name><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1993</year><article-title>Cytotoxic effector cell granules recognized by the monoclonal antibody TIA-1 are present in CD8&#x0002b; lymphocytes in lymph nodes of human immunodeficiency virus-1-infected patients.</article-title><source>Am J Pathol</source><volume>142</volume><fpage>1750</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8506945</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001915-Cheynier1"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cheynier</su